# Nexus AI overview
Nexus AI is a multi-agent financial intelligence platform with:
- FastAPI backend
- Next.js frontend
- WebSocket streaming
- ChromaDB vector memory
- NetworkX graph memory
- SQLite time-series tracking
- Demo-first synthetic data mode

# Global rules
- Plan before implementation.
- Keep changes small and reviewable.
- Preserve backend/frontend contracts.
- Validate all structured messages.
- Prefer typed models over ad hoc dicts.
- Maintain demo mode stability at all times.
